        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rudolf Plajner\n- Organizations: Junák, Schutzstaffel\n- Roles: Chief Scout of Junák, State Secretary, Reichsführer-SS\n\nFacts:\n- Rudolf Plajner was declared Chief Scout of Junák while a State Secretary was in office.\n- Reichsführer-SS was a rank in the Schutzstaffel.\n- The rank of Reichsführer-SS was higher than the rank of the State Secretary who was in office when Rudolf Plajner was declared Chief Scout of Junák.",
